{
  "id": "unique-event-022",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#22 -  Shattering The Dark Mirror\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1347,1381]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You throw an old, heavy vase at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1381,1413]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the mirror, shattering it. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1413,1444]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ghosts of Seth and Tabitha Rosen\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1444,1477]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "appear in front of you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1477,1501]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“Thank you. You are a good soul”,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1501,1535]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "says Tabitha, and hands you a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1535,1565]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "folded piece of parchment. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1565,1596]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shiver at the touch of the ghost’s\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1596,1631]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "cold, semi-immaterial fingers.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1631,1662]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You unfold the parchment. There\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1662,1694]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is some sort of magical symbol\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1694,1725]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "drawn in dark brown ink. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1725,1757]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "were cursed, the curse is lifted,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1757,1791]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and the protection offered by this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1791,1826]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "amulet lets you recover 3 Sanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1826,1859]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1859,1867]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Seth explains to you that there was\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1867,1903]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "an occult war between their coven\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1903,1937]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of good witches and a dark coven\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1937,1970]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of children who worshipped",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1970,1996]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Snowy Samuel, a white goat with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,22,54]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "red eyes. The only way to stop the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,54,89]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Snowy Samuel cult was to kill the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,89,123]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children in a ritual.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,123,145]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“Our souls will scream for all\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,145,176]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "eternity for what we have done…\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,176,208]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "but there was no other way”. Seth\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,208,242]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "explains that the seven children\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,242,275]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "were hanged from the tree and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,275,305]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "buried next to its roots.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,305,331]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“Do not dig their graves, because\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,331,365]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "they are powerful even in death\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,365,397]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and may return to haunt the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,397,425]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "world.”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,425,433]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Before you can ask any additional\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,433,467]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "questions, the ghosts of Seth and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,467,501]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Tabitha disappear in a black mist.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,501,536]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-022:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Return to your exploration.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,536,564]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    85,
    86
  ]
}
